LXDE is a ultra fast and ultra lightweight GTK+ based desktop environment for X.

For Both x86_64 And i686
Installation sudo apt install lxde gnome-software -y

Lightdm
Syslack Linux x86_64 uses LightDM GTK Greeter by Default
Syslack Linux i686 uses LightDM Unity Greeter

Enabling Display Manager

For both x86_64 and i686
sudo systemctl enable lightdm
sudo systemctl start lightdm

NOTE=Syslack Linux with LXDE installs GNOME Software by default but if its heavy you dont need to install it
